# Git remote: lurnic-new

This repo's **canonical remote** is **`lurnic-new`** → `https://github.com/faisalbhxyz/lurnic-monorepo-vercel.git`.

When the user asks to commit or push:

- **Always push to `lurnic-new` first** — this is the production/canonical repo.
- Command: `git push lurnic-new HEAD` (or `git push lurnic-new master` on master).
- Do **not** push to `origin` (`adstryker/lurnic-server`) or `fbh` unless the user explicitly asks.
- After commit, verify: `git rev-parse master` must match `lurnic-new/master`.

New branch: `git push -u lurnic-new HEAD`
